Using Cartans nomenclature \[Zeta]0, \[Zeta]1, x1, x2, x3\
\>", "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Clear", "[", 
  RowBox[{"\[Zeta]0", ",", "\[Zeta]1", ",", "x1", ",", " ", "X2", ",", "x3"}],
   "]"}]], "Input"],

Cell["\<\

Single inserted value thus single assumtion: \[Zeta]0 = I a Complex Enity \
that is not NULL\
\>", "Text"],

