  3.671684050977368*^9, 3.680924437285785*^9, 3.681523362198785*^9}]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Take Conjugate \[Zeta]0 as \[OpenCurlyQuote]Hole\[CloseCurlyQuote] in or \
\[OpenCurlyQuote]Shaddow\[CloseCurlyQuote] on the NULL Plane by existence of \
\[Zeta]0
Genitive value reflecting lack of: \[Zeta]0 + Conjugate[\[Zeta]0] must sum to \
NULL 
Core of symmetry 
Mathematically a Reflection thus a Rotation.
\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.681523492097355*^9, 3.6815235039331*^9}}],

